Materials of LM3032 Amplifier
LM3032 IC (main amplifier chip)
Speaker (4Ω or 8Ω)
Audio input source (phone, laptop, or microphone)
Potentiometer (for volume control)
Capacitors (for filtering and stability)
Resistors (for biasing and circuit protection)
Power supply (usually 5V–12V DC depending on circuit design)
Breadboard or PCB (for assembling the circuit)
Connecting wires (jumper wires)
Audio jack (3.5mm input)
Switch (optional for power control)
